# Negative-control mutant — delegates delegated-access
#
# AC it must flip:   AC-DL11
# Test that goes red: delegates.delegated-access.int.test.ts >
#   "AC-DL11 carries delegated access to the account whose invitation was accepted"
# Mutation: mapSessionUser (session-store) drops the `delegated_ids` mapping and
#   always returns `{}`, so a delegated client's identity reports no delegated
#   access — the granted access is invisible from the invitee's side.
# Note: AC-DL12 (no delegated access) stays green — its recorded `delegated_ids`
#   is null, which maps to `{}` either way.
#
# Apply with:  git apply <this file>   (run from repo root)
# Revert with: git apply -R <this file>
diff --git a/packages/headless/src/modules/session-store/session-store.mappers.ts b/packages/headless/src/modules/session-store/session-store.mappers.ts
index da8c9a3b9..9c75aa77f 100644
